From 8b57bcf5ad1f57e7185d209a846961eb126f72f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 15:11:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01020/11171] [outer-loop] harness: pre-create checkpoint_path
 leaf dir (fixes Stage-1 dump save crash)

The first GAP-3 Stage-1 dump completed all 100 batches of GPU inference then crashed
at torch.save: pretrain.evaluate() only makedirs the PARENT of checkpoint_path, so a
fresh leaf dir (eval_out/arc_v1_latent) did not exist (the old arc_v1 dir had
pre-existed, hiding the bug). Harness now os.makedirs(checkpoint_path, exist_ok=True)
before the run so the save always lands. Stage 1 re-run deferred to next session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
